. Udyam\n \nRegistration Certificate is used by enterprises to be classified as MSMEs and for \navailing benefits of Ministry of MSME’s schemes and programmes. The major schemes that provide \ncollateral free bank credit are Emergency Credit Lined Guarantee Scheme (ECLGS\n) and Credit \nGuarantee Scheme (CGS) for Micro and Small Enterprises (MSEs). The details of the State wise \nguarantees issued during the last three years and the current year for the scheme ECLGS and Credit \nGuarantee Scheme (CGS) for MSEs are at \nAnnexure I\n. \nCredit Guarantee Trust Fund for Micro and \nSmall Enterprises (CGTMSE) provides guarantee coverage for MSE loans including startups for \nloans upto Rs 2.00 crore extended by its Member Lending Institutions (MLIs) as per their own \nprocedures. \n \n \n               \n                                                                                                                      \n \n****\n \n \n         \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n\n \n  \nAnnexure I\n \n \nAnnexure referred to in reply\n \nto part (a) to (d)\n \nof Lok Sabha Unstarred\n \nQuestion No. 89 for answer on \n02.02.2023\n \n(i) Number and Amount of Guarantees issued under Emergency Credit Lined Guarantee Scheme (ECLGS)\n \nStates/UTs data for ECLGS\n \n \nState/UT\n \nFY 2020\n-\n21\n \nFY 2021\n-\n2022\n \nFY (2022\n-\n2023) Till 31 Dec \n2022\n \nNo.  of \nGuarantees \nIssued\n \nLoan \nAmount \nGuaranteed \n(Rs. In Cr)\n \nNo.  of \nGuarantees \nIssued\n \nLoan Amount \nGuaranteed \n(Rs. In Cr)\n \nNo.  of \nGuarantees \nIssued\n \nLoan Amount \nGuaranteed \n(Rs. In Cr)\n \nAndaman & Nicobar\n \n1,978\n \n96.01\n \n123\n \n44.55\n \n24\n \n13.11\n \nAndhra Pradesh\n \n2,53,111\n \n8,659.26\n \n37,711\n \n3,560.14\n \n3,033\n \n833.77\n \nArunachal Pradesh\n \n2,228\n \n7,1.32\n \n159\n \n57.94\n \n44\n \n5.77\n \nAssam\n \n5,29,128\n \n2,715.09\n \n23,527\n \n807.08\n \n1,690\n \n269.54\n \nBihar\n \n6,44,959\n \n3,784.61\n \n1,84,637\n \n1,194.56\