f Parsis in India. \n(7) Qaumi WaTf Board TaraTTiati Scheme (QWBTS) and Shahari WaTf Sampatti Vikas \nYojana (SWSVY).  \n (D) IQIUaVtUXctXUe DeYeOoSPeQt ScKePeV \n(8) Pradhan Mantri Jan Vikas Karyakram (PMJVK)  \n(b) & (c): Scheme- wise and year-wise details of funds allocated (RE) and number of \nbeneficiaries during the last five years w.e.f.  2016-17 to 2021-22 are available on the website \nof the Ministry i.e. www.minorityaffairs.gov.in.  \n(d) & (e): Budgetary allocation of Schemes being implemented by Ministry of Minority \nAffairs are assessed from time to time and accordingly allocation is made under the schemes \nas per reTuirement. Since 2014-15 to 2022-23, allocation under the schemes being \nimplemented by the Ministry has been increased from Rs. 3711.00 crore to Rs. 5020.50 crore. \n***** \n  \n \n\n-2- \n28 M/s Metallic Bellows India Pvt. Ltd, Chennai MSME Tamil Nadu \n29 M/s Chakradhara Aerospace & Cargo Pvt Ltd, \nCoimbatore \nMSME Tamil Nadu \n30 M/s Azista Industries Pvt. Ltd., Hyderabad MSME Telangana \n31 M/s. High Energy Batteries (India) Ltd, Chennai MSME Tamil Nadu \n32 Jishnu Communication Ltd., Hyderabad MSME Telangana \n33 M/s Smart Machine & Structures, Hyderabad MSME Telangana \n34 M/s Navstar Integrated Systems Pvt. Ltd, \nHyderabad, Telangana \nMSME Telangana \n35 M/s Rasu Tools Ltd., Sangareddy (Telangana) MSME Telangana \n36 M/s Nucon Aerospace Pvt. Ltd, Hyderabad MSME Telangana \n37 Samtel Avionics Ltd. , Noida MSME Uttar Pradesh \n38 M/s Inochi Care Pvt Ltd, Jorhat (Assam) Start-up Assam \n39 M/s Ingenious Research Solutions Pvt. Ltd. , \nFaridabad \nStart-up Haryana \n40 Bellatrix Aerospace Pvt. Ltd Bangalore Start-up Karnataka \n41 M/s NewSpace Research and Technologies Pvt \nLtd, Bengaluru \nStart-up Karnataka \n42 M/s Frshr Technologies Pvt Ltd, Bangalore Start-up Karnataka \n43 M/s Vashishtha Research \nPvt.Ltd.,Thiruvananthapuram (D2D winner) \nStart-up Kerala \n44 M/s Combat Robotics India Pvt. Ltd., Chikhali Start-up Madhya